{"_note":"§2 段标题 = 左名字 + 右摘要,**两侧同为 13pt/sub**。此前左侧用的是一档偏深的墨色、右侧 10.5pt —— 同一个包里首页与详情页两种段标题。\n「用户评论」分组标题(v40),右侧 = 条数 + ›(整行在 XPage 层可点 → /reviews 评论页)。rvN=0 时右侧只显「0 条」不带 ›、走灰 —— 没东西可看就别装成入口。","rc":{"cells":[{"id":"t","type":"txt","x":"0pt","y":"16pt","w":"{parent.w}-100pt","h":"-1","text":"${@i18n.title}","fontSize":"13pt","typeface":"System-Bold","textColor":"#6B7280|#8E939B","maxLines":"1"},{"type":"op","action":"if","props":{"val":"$[ge::(findNotEmpty::(${rvN},0),1)]"},"react":[{"id":"r","type":"txt","x":"{parent.w}-96pt","y":"19pt","w":"96pt","h":"-1","text":"$[findNotEmpty::(${rvN},0)] ${@i18n.count} ›","fontSize":"13pt","alignmentH":"2","textColor":"#0A7AFF|#4DA0FF","maxLines":"1"}]},{"type":"op","action":"if","props":{"val":"$[if::(ge::(findNotEmpty::(${rvN},0),1),0,1)]"},"react":[{"id":"r0","type":"txt","x":"{parent.w}-96pt","y":"19pt","w":"96pt","h":"-1","text":"0 ${@i18n.count}","fontSize":"13pt","alignmentH":"2","textColor":"#6B7280|#8E939B","maxLines":"1"}]}],"i18n":{"zh-CN":{"title":"用户评论 · 最新","count":"条"},"en-US":{"title":"Reviews · latest","count":"reviews"}}}}
